  `3 + num_oov_buckets - 1 = 7`, calculated by:
  `hash(<term>) % num_oov_buckets + vocab_size`

  If input_tensor is:

  >>> input_tensor = tf.constant(["emerson", "lake", "palmer",
  ...                             "king", "crimson"])
