  * `emerson -> 0`
  * `lake -> 1`
  * `palmer -> 2`
  * `<other term> -> bucket_id`, where `bucket_id` will be between `3` and
  `3 + num_oov_buckets - 1 = 7`, calculated by:
  `hash(<term>) % num_oov_buckets + vocab_size`

